## Requirements

- Node >= {{NODE_MIN}} (`nvm use` reads `.nvmrc`)
- JDK {{JDK}}, Android SDK with API {{MIN_SDK}}+ installed
- Xcode (iOS {{IOS_TARGET}} deployment target), CocoaPods via Bundler
- Watchman (recommended on macOS)

## Run

```sh
{{PM}} install
{{#if expo}}
{{PM}} run prebuild          # generates ios/ and android/
{{PM}} run ios               # or: {{PM}} run android
{{else}}
{{PM}} run pods              # bundle exec pod install (first run: bundle install)
{{PM}} run ios               # or: {{PM}} run android
{{/if}}
{{PM}} run start             # Metro, if not started by the run command
```

Environment values live in `.env.development` (dev builds) and `.env.production` (release builds); only publishable keys belong there, and changing one needs a native rebuild.

## Verify

`{{PM}} run verify` runs typecheck, lint and jest — the done gate CI enforces on every PR.
{{#if sample}}
Smoke flows live in `.maestro/` (`maestro test .maestro/login.yaml`).
{{/if}}

